<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo ends steady vs mark after apathetic session.</title>
<headline>Escudo ends steady vs mark after apathetic session.</headline>
<text>
<p>1654 GMT - The escudo closed steady against the mark after an apathetic session with attention focused on movements in the dollar, dealers said. The escudo closed at 100.83/86 per mark, unchanged from the opening.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
